-- expect-row: po_ok[main](wc,g1)
-- A SHRUG ON ITS OWN GROUP, the others kept: a member a completion adds
-- (g1, g5 but for the sum and max), a projection one adds (sum/sq/max/q90 g2),
-- a group one makes (g3; g7, whose one member weighs 0: a sum of it is 0
-- or none), a member a negation may take away (neg g4),
-- a group one position of which it leaves open (pair (g1,h2): h1's k is held)
-- expect-row: po_ok[main](cnt,g1)
-- expect-row: po_ok[main](cnt,g3)
